## Installation

### From source (development)

```bash
# Using echi
echi install

# Or directly with ChimeraX
ChimeraX --nogui --exit --cmd 'devel install .'
```

### From wheel

```bash
ChimeraX --nogui --exit --cmd 'toolshed install dist/{{bundle_name}}-{{version}}-py3-none-any.whl'
```

## Development

```bash
# Build wheel
echi build

# Install to ChimeraX
echi install

# Build, install, and launch ChimeraX
echi run

# Run with a test script
echi run --script scripts/smoke.cxc
```

